{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n '\"'^#{1,5} |provenance|reserved'\"' docs/design/yang.antlr.md docs/design/yang.typescript.md docs/design/yang.php.md src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md\"","aggregated_output":"src/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:1:# Yin VM - State Documentation\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:5:## Overview\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:14:## State Structure\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:19: :store        <map>                 ; Heap memory (reserved for future)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:24:## Field Descriptions\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:26:### `:control` - Current Expression\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:53:### `:environment` - Variable Bindings\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:89:### `:store` - Heap Memory\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:95:**Current Status:** Not yet implemented, reserved for future use\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:111:### `:owner` - The Task's Owner Tag\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:117:### `:heap` and `:gc` - Task Heap and Its Collector\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:119:**Type:** `:heap` is `{cell-id {:value v :seal s :provenance p}}`; `:gc` is `{:since n :base b :threshold t :pinned #{cell-id}}`\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/state.md:123:**Provenance:** an entry may carry an optional private `:provenance` sibling beside `:value` and `:seal`, written only by the privileged mint (`cell/dsg__new-provenance`, effect `:cell/new-provenance`) at allocation, never attached, replaced, or cleared afterwards. The VM treats it as opaque data — no frontend dispatch, no reason matching, no rendering — and answers it only through the authenticated private reader (`cell/dsg__provenance`, effect `:cell/provenance`), which returns nil for anything else and is never fatal. `cell/get` returns only `:value`; `cell/set!` and `heap-write` preserve `:provenance` while updating `:value`/`:seal`. The collector traces `:provenance` as data from every live entry, from pinned entries, and 