ndition and authenticates THAT outer condition\n2650:        :else (throw (yang.call/condition :yang.call/not-callable {:yang.call/callee f}))))\n2917:(defn library-for\n2918:  \"The definitions of `library` that `forms` need: those whose names `forms`\n2990:  ;; compiler-private (`dsg__`) name than a whole program can. Trusted\n2992:  ;; `dsg__` temporaries via `compile-form` directly.\n3022:   :linked-runtime true,\n3129:(defn lower-unit\n3139:   `yang.call` call sites need no free-name declaration: the convention\n3141:   the donor publication pins the `yang.call` module for the qualified\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
