{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"I found concrete problems in the Python-to-Clojure profile: its raw float arithmetic is not portable under the repository’s carrier rules, and several hooks have different argument or outcome contracts from the Python lowering they replace. The design needs to specify those adaptations before P2/P3 can be judged implementable."}}
